  "originalText": "[Code Name] Scavenger\n[Gender] Female\n[Combat Experience] 4 years\n[Place of Birth] Unknown\n[Date of Birth] August 22\n[Race] Zalak\n[Height] 164cm\n[Infection Status] \nInfection confirmed by medical examination.",
